{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/874185-dumb-dumb-question","id":874185,"title":"Dumb, Dumb Question...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-25T19:20:37-07:00","id":874185,"title":"Dumb, Dumb Question...","content":"So... what Disciplines is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ux_TzeaEAPk\" target=\"_blank\">Midnight Bliss</a> a Devotion of?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-25T19:57:44-07:00","id":874212,"title":"","content":"I always loved that game. I had Bishamon's armor in an Aegis Kai Doru vault.<br /> <br /> I think it's at least two actions.<br /> <br /> The first is either Lashing Out with the Seductive Beast, forcing a Wanton Condition on the target. Or a blast of Majesty with the Green Eyes Discipline, forcing the character to fall for Demitri's charms. Really, there's a lot of ways you could pull that part off.<br /> <br /> If you want to include the change the target takes, there's a Devotion called Transgression of Attis that apparently causes a willing target to switch gender. This Devotions is in Bloodlines: the Legendary. <br /> <br /> The second thing you have is an Investment from Belial's Brood, Blood Calls to Blood. It basically causes Lethal damage and drains the blood from a living target at range, forcing it to come to the vampire, usually seeping along the ground but considering how close they are the air seems fine. It will do the same to other vampires, except 'merely' draining their Vitae.<br /> <br /> If you want to include the 'burning' after that, there's another Belial's Brood Investment, the next level of Blood Calls to Blood, that causes the target's blood to boil out of the target's skin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T01:38:17-07:00","id":874347,"title":"","content":"Looks like Majesty/Dominate + Protean + Vigor (tho, not sure what's the purpose of Protean in that one, besides badass points)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T01:38:17-07:00","id":874348,"title":"","content":"failed double post is fail","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T03:59:13-07:00","id":874390,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't do a single devotion, but rather a series of abilities.<br /> <br /> Transforming into the man-beast thing is Protean. Don't really need a devotion for that part. Making your victim into a sexualized woman/child version of themselves? Honestly, I'm not even going to touch that part. I find it too disturbing and a message I don't want to discuss, and I cannot think of any reason that it should be a thing.<br /> <br /> For the part of draining blood out of someone? In Masquerade, that was part of the Path of Blood thaumaturgy power set. In Requiem 1e, it was a Brood Investment called Blood Calls to Blood. Under 2e rules, I would recommend actually making it into a Cruac ritual that you prepare, much like Touch of the Morrigan and the upcoming Gaze of the Gorgon ritual, rather than a devotion. Blood manipulation of that level seems to fall under blood sorceries intead of core disciplines/devotions. Or a bloodline discpline.<br /> <br /> Bursting into flames isn't possible under 2e rules without using a Coil to get the mortal pyrokinesis psychic ability. Vampires cannot use fire magics by default.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 04-26-2016, 07:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T10:47:45-07:00","id":874671,"title":"","content":"As much as the woman/child version thing is kind of disturbing if it happened in reality (or even a real world setting like the ChoD) feels like a Taurobolium devotion with prerequisite of some variety (I'm not familiar enough with VtR 2nd edtion to give a firm answer there but the Ordo Dracul's coils is my first look at, maybe Cruac?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}